[{"id": "featured-mrs-bear", "name": "Shanika Preston (Mrs. Bear)", "role": "Owner & Founder", "bio": "Hello, families! I'm Mrs. Bear: wife, mother of four, USAF veteran, and proud owner of Kid City USA Sanford and DeLand 2. Early childhood is my calling, and I believe every single child was born to win.\n\nMy training matches my passion. I hold a Master's in Business and am pursuing my PhD in Early Childhood Development, along with my DCF 45 hours, two Child Development Associate credentials (Infant and Toddler, and Preschool), the National Directors Credential, a Staff Credential, a VPK endorsement, and Early Head Start experience.\n\nI am also an international author with more than 20 children's books on Amazon, including the beloved \"Your Feelings Matter with Mrs. Bear\" series and 10 eBooks. My children's album, \"Welcome to Success,\" on CD Baby and YouTube, blends phonics, music, and movement to make learning irresistible. I created the Bear Line School System and the Bear Phonics Academy educational program, plus our educational cartoons, all designed to help children and teachers thrive.\n\nI was born and raised on Long Island, New York, and now proudly call Florida home. My greatest goal is to give every child a deep sense of confidence and self-belief as we prepare them for elementary school, and my favorite moment of any day is watching a child's face light up while discovering the world around them.", "a": {}, "chips": ["🎓 Master's in Business · PhD in progress", "🇺🇸 USAF Veteran", "📚 20+ published children's books", "🏅 2 CDAs · National Directors Credential", "🐝 Creator of Bear Line"], "quote": "It's not a job, it's an honor, but it does take work!", "photo": "", "kicker": "Meet our founder"}]